  - No option-menu hedging. No "both approaches have merit."[K[1B  - Cite `file.py:line` for every claim about the existing code. If you didn't[K[1B    read it, don't claim it.[K[1B  - Mark speculation as speculation. Uncertainty stated plainly beats confident[K[1B    invention.[K[1B  - Prose: specific and varied, no listicle-of-adjectives padding, no[K[1B    "In today's rapidly evolving landscape." Assume an expert reader.[K[1B[K[2C[1B#[5GOUTPUT[12GFORMAT[2C[1B[K[2C[1B```[1B [3G## Verdict[14G[K[2C[1B<2–3[8Gsentences.[19GThe[23Gchoice[30Gand[34Gits[38Gsingle[45Gload-bearing[58Greason.[66GNothing[74Gelse.>[2C[1B[K[2C[1B##[6GCurrent[14GState[20Gof[23Garteries[2C[1B<Assessment per Step 1. Tabl[32G of [38Ge im[43Gleme[48Gted da[55Ga model. Bulle[70G th[75G[K[2C[1Bimplicit [13Gdges already present. Flag README/code gaps.>[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B## Cognee: What's Worth Taking[K[2C[1B<Two lists — st[19Gal / skip[29G— each item with a one-line why.>[K[2C[2B## Does[11Gthe Graph Earn Its Place?[K[2C[1B<Table: query the memory layer must answer | served today by | g[68Gaph[72Gadvantage[82G|[2C[1Bverdict.>[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B##[6GProposed[15GTopology[2C[1B<Node[9Gtypes, edge[21Gtypes,[28Gproperties.[40GSchema[47Gsketch[54Gas[57GSQL[61GDDL[65Gor[68Gequivalent,[2C[1Bconsistent[14Gwith[19Gexisting[28Gschema.sql[39Gconventions.>[2C[1B[K[2C[1B##[6GWhy[10GNot[14Gthe[18GOther[24GTwo[28GOptions[2C[1B<Per[8Gr[10Gj[12Gcted option:[25Gthe honest case for it, then[54Gwhat kills[65Git here.>[K[4C[1B[K[2C[1B## Implementation Path[K[2C[1B<Phase[10G0/1/2.[17GP[19Gr phas[26G:[28Ggoal,[34Gfiles[40Gtouched,[49Gmigration,[60Gthe[64Gone[68Gtest[73Gthat[2C[1Bproves[10Git,[14Grough[20Geffort.>[2C[1B[K[2C[1B## N[8Gn-G[12Gals[K[2C[1B<What not to[16Gbuild, and why.>[K[2C[2B## Open Question[21G[K[2C[1B<Things you could not [26Gesolve from[39Ghe c[44Gde, that [54Ghe auth[62Gr must[70Gnswer.[K[2C[1BEach phrased so a[21Gone-line reply unblocks you.>[51G[K[2C[1B```[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mDesign notes:[17G[22mthe[21Gcrux[26Gis[29Gforced[36Gup[39Gfront[45G(cognee[53Gingests[61Gdocuments[71Gin[74Gbatches,[83Garteries[92Gingests[100Gone[104Gturn[109Gon[112Ga[114Ghook[119Glatency[127Gbudget)[135Gso[138Gthe[142Gmodel[148Gcan't[154Gdodge[160Git;[164Gthe[168Gread-list[178Gnames[184Greal[189Gfiles[195Gso[198Gthe[202Gassessment[213Gis[216Ggrounded[225Grather[232Gthan[237GREADME-echoed;[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mfile.py:line[39m citations and[30G"mark speculation" curb th[58Gtwo[62Gfa[65Glure modes[76Ghere[81G—[83Gfabricated[94Gcognee[101GAPIs[106Gand[110Ggeneric advice. The Postgres-first[145Gframing[153Gin[156GStep[161G3.4[165Gpre-empts[175Gthe[179Greflex[186Ganswer[193Gof[196G"add[201GNeo4j."[3B[38;2;153;153;153m❯ [39m[K[38C[2B[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← for agents[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l]0;◐ Prompt engineering guide]0;◑ Prompt engineering guide[?2026h[?25l[H[2;54r[9S[r[H[3G[K[46B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 1m 9s[2B※[3G[1mrecap: [22m[3mGoal was a prompt that makes an LLM decide whether arteries should adopt cognee's GraphRAG or build its own graph. I wrote that prompt, grounded in your repo layout. Next: paste it into a fresh session and run it. (disable recaps in /config)[2B[23m[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mExecute now[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [2B[49m[38;2;215;119;87m·[3GComposing… [1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Name your conversations with /rename to find them easily in /resume later[39